que Robots</strong><br> During your tower exploration, you\u2019ll encounter many robots with distinct personalities scattered around. Some are friendly, some mysterious, and some... downright mean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/21c887f90f8c99e367cd015d2c62ab01.poster.avif?t=1756734765\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/21c887f90f8c99e367cd015d2c62ab01.webm?t=1756734765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/extras/21c887f90f8c99e367cd015d2c62ab01.mp4?t=1756734765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments and Varied Mechanism Challenges</strong><br> On your adventure, you will traverse multiple visually unique environments, each with its own mechanisms.<br> Foggy forests, scorching lava, slippery ice plains... every step is a new trial.<br> You never know if the next moment will be a relief or a sudden disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Warning</strong><br> Don\u2019t say we didn\u2019t warn you\u2014this game is likely to cause:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploding emotions \ud83d\udca3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse flying off the desk \ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking to yourself: \u201cDidn\u2019t I just jump over that?!\u201d \ud83e\udd2f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and an irresistible \u201cjust one more try\u201d obsession.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend players:<br> \u2705 Stay calm<br> \u2705 Take deep breaths<br> \u2705 Invest in a durable keyboard (it will get some hits)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Is This Game For?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore players who love challenging themselves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of \u201csuffering\u201d style games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content creators seeking high-intensity audience interaction during streams/videos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectors who enjoy the cute style combined with prankish gameplay contrasts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Challenge <i>Rage Tower</i> and see if you can beat it with a smile\u2014or smash your keyboard!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Add it to your wishlist now and prepare for this adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Blabla games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867710/eca89b306cde6a3d528488d1ddf364ab87a9e29c/header.jpg?t=1756734765","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867710/1555265145/d3d40e1b9dab84a823f5171c376768b3ee245a68/1754656059/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754657575","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867710/1555265145/d3d40e1b9dab84a823f5171c376768b3ee245a68/1754656059/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754657575","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867710/1555265145/d3d40e1b9dab84a823f5171c376768b3ee245a68/1754656059/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754657575","id":257180342,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180342/movie480.mp4?t=1754657575","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180342/movie_max.mp4?t=1754657575"},"name":"Rage Tower: Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180342/4eef4f8ece70c3ae8261a8489b775e973a42